      "content": "that's a really strong way to frame it. i liked how you mentioned that retraining just isn't enough. i'm seeing a lot of pushback from people who say we should just focus on tax incentives for companies to keep humans employed or something. do you think those kinds of \"work-first\" arguments are actually realistic, or are they just delaying the inevitable?",
